    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF2 — VAPI Event Router\n\nSingle webhook URL given to VAPI. Receives ALL events and routes them.\n\n**Routing:**\n- `tool-calls` → WF3 Tool Dispatcher (synchronous — waits for response)\n- `end-of-call-report` → WF4 Post-Call Processor (async — fire and forget)\n- Everything else → 200 OK, ignored\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Activate this workflow\n2. Copy the Production webhook URL from the Webhook node\n3. Paste it into VAPI assistant → Server URL\n\n**Upstream:** VAPI (all events)\n**Downstream:** WF3 (tool calls), WF4 (post-call)",
        "height": 472,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-wf2",
      "name": "📋 WF2 Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "vapi-events",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "headerAuth"
      },
      "id": "wf2-webhook",
      "name": "VAPI Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
