    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Tool-Calls Branch**\n\nVAPI needs a response within 5 seconds.\nCalls WF3 synchronously, waits for completion,\nthen returns `{ results: [...] }` directly to VAPI.\n\nWF3 handles all 7 tools internally.\n\n**Error Handling:** If WF3 crashes, Handle WF3 Response builds a graceful fallback using the original toolCallIds — VAPI never times out silently.",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-tools",
      "name": "📞 Tool-Calls Branch",
